    <div style="background-color: #1a1a1a; padding-left: 1.5rem;" class="py-6 pr-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-yellow-600 shadow-lg mb-8">
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        1. Journal daily<br />
        2. Turn energy into productivity<br />
        <br />
        Added 251123:<br />
        3. I want to get a time tracker processer going on the site.<br />
        4. I want to make progress on boot.dev daily.<br />
        5. Bike Daily to match TuFastTuFurious.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Long term Todos</h1>
    <div style="background-color: #1a1a1a; padding-left: 1.5rem;" class="py-6 pr-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-yellow-600 shadow-lg">
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        - Link todo-app to site<br />
        - Get degree in artificial intelligence?<br />
